title: "Consciousness Capacity Verification (NEWIDEAS-D-25-00768)"
abstract: "Dependency-free verification code that recomputes the functional consciousness capacity values C(S) from the paper's own equations (A.1, E.4, E.5, E.7, D.1, D.3), documents the provenance of every input, and seals the package with a SHA-256 Merkle tree."
